      "message": "I had to bring back this conditional. Without it, this CL encounters presubmit errors because some non installable apexes used in CTS tests (e.g. [ApexKeyRotationTestV2_SignedBob](https://cs.android.com/android/_/android/platform/cts/+/2a9bae067b92da48bece73c05c51ddc434a96208:hostsidetests/stagedinstall/Android.bp;l\u003d97-118;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0;drc\u003d037399cc24df533920b8014488bc8f16ec203e16)) currently do not declare their `apps`.\n\nEven though the apex is not installed on any product, the validation is triggered for all prebuilt apexes (installed + not installed) at ToT today. When `RELEASE_APKCERTS_INSTALL_ONLY` is moved to `trunk_staging` and beyond, I think we can drop this conditional.",
